put('hnet-cnn-receptive','Setting 2：共享选子给相同感受野','Setting 2: shared child selection gives identical fields',r'R_{(1,h,w)}^{(l)}=\cdots=R_{(C,h,w)}^{(l)}',
'共享的是选子参数与感受野，不是各通道ReLU后输出的非零状态。','The channels share child selection and receptive fields; their post-ReLU nonzero states need not agree.',[
step('hnet-cnn-selection','从参数到子集合',r'相同的 $\tau$ 经同一个逐坐标阈值给相同的二值对角矩阵 $\Sigma$，从而选中完全相同的孩子节点。该推论不涉及卷积权重 $A_c$。',en=('Pass from parameters to selected children',r'Identical selection parameters pass through the same coordinatewise threshold, producing identical binary diagonal matrices and exactly the same child nodes. This argument is independent of the convolution weights.')),
step('hnet-cnn-field','按并集定义逐式推出',r'每个父通道的场均是它所选孩子场的并集；选子集合已相同，孩子场是前层固定对象，因此这些并集完全相同。重复归纳至输入后得到所述等式。改变通道线性权重不改变该场定义。',decl='Harsanyi.Network.receptive_shared_children',en=('Apply the union definition exactly',r'Each parent field is the union of its selected child fields. Since the selected children coincide and their fields are fixed previous-layer objects, these unions coincide. Recursing to the inputs proves the stated equality. Changing channel weights leaves the field definition unchanged.')),
step('hnet-cnn-not-output','分辨原证明的激活句',r'原文随后称同孩子使 $h_c$ 同时激活/失活。AND gate的开闭确实相同，但线性权重不同，故 $g_1=1,g_2=-1$ 的同孩子例子经ReLU给 $(z_1,z_2)=(1,0)$。共享gate不等于全部输出同时非零；这个错误不影响上述感受野等式。',en=('Separate the printed activation claim',r'The source subsequently says that shared children make all channels activate or deactivate together. Their gates do open and close together, but different linear weights may yield preactivations 1 and -1, hence post-ReLU outputs (1,0). A common gate does not force simultaneous nonzero outputs. This error does not affect the proved field equality.'))],decls=['Harsanyi.Network.receptive_shared_children'])
put('hnet-cnn-regroup','Setting 2：通道重组、原错式与分组gate','Setting 2: channel regrouping, printed errors and grouped gates',r'I(S=R_u)=\sum_{l,u}w_u^{(l)}J_u^{(l)}(S=R_u)=\sum_{l,u}w_u^{(l)}z_u^{(l)}(x)',
'原全单元和遗漏目标感受野过滤；正确加权重组与新分组gate的R1/R2可直接证明。','The printed sum omits the target-field filter. Correct weighted regrouping and the new grouped gate’s R1/R2 admit direct proofs.',[
step('hnet-cnn-filter','保留原错式并恢复索引',r'固定一个目标集合 $S$。Theorem2给 $I(S)=\sum_jw_jJ_j(S)$；实际架构只在 $R_j=S$ 时 $J_j(S)=z_j(x)$，其他项为零。因此应保留指示过滤。PDF16把所有单元 $z_j$ 无条件相加；例如两个单元场分别 $\{1\},\{2\}$ 且贡献各1，对 $S=\{1\}$ 左边1而该印刷末和2。这个中间等式错误；不能把被选单元下标在等式两侧悄悄变成全部单元。',r'I(S)=\sum_j\mathbf1_{R_j=S}w_jz_j(x)',en=('Preserve the printed error and restore its index',r'Fix a target set. The readout theorem gives the weighted sum of unit dividends, and only units with that target field contribute their values. The field indicator must therefore remain. Page 16 instead sums every unit value: two unit fields {1} and {2} with contribution 1 each give target-{1} dividend 1 but printed final sum 2. This is an erroneous intermediate equality; the selected index cannot silently become the full unit index.')),
step('hnet-cnn-regroup-finite','同一网络的有限和重组',r'同一位置 $p$ 的所有通道共享 $R_p$。把标量求和的索引 $j=(p,c)$ 写成有限积集，有限和交换给 $I(S)=\sum_{p:R_p=S}\sum_cw_{p,c}z_{p,c}=\sum_{p:R_p=S}w_p^\top z_p$。对空场实际架构的向量恒零。此式是同一组实际输出的精确重组，无须假设通道同时非零。',decl='Harsanyi.Network.channel_grouping',en=('Regroup a single network’s finite readout',r'Every channel at one position shares that position’s field. Reindex the scalar units by position and channel, then exchange finite sums to obtain the vector dot-product readout, retaining the target-field restriction. An empty-field vector is zero in the actual architecture. This regrouping uses the same actual outputs and requires no simultaneous nonzero-channel assumption.')),
step('hnet-cnn-group-mask','直接证明新group gate的掩码律',r'新gate对每个孩子位置测试 $\sum_c|z_{p,c}|\ne0$，等价于该有限向量至少一个坐标非零。设孩子组已满足逐坐标掩码律。若父场全保留，每个孩子场全保留，向量各坐标、线性和及gate完全不变。若有父场变量缺失，场并集找出一个受影响孩子，其全部坐标按归纳为零，绝对值和零，使group gate关闭，父所有通道输出零。叶子把同位置输入向量作为一个变量，掩码把整向量置零，故满足基例。这完成有限CNN前馈层的归纳，不依赖与旧scalar gate的数值等价。',decl='Harsanyi.Network.groupedBlock_mask',en=('Prove the new grouped gate’s mask law directly',r'The new gate tests whether the sum of channel absolute values at each child position is nonzero, equivalently whether that finite vector has a nonzero coordinate. Assume the child vectors satisfy their coordinatewise mask laws. Retaining the parent field retains every child field, so every coordinate, weighted sum and gate is unchanged. If a parent-field variable is missing, the union supplies an affected child whose coordinates all vanish by induction. Its absolute-value sum is zero, closing the grouped gate and making every parent channel zero. A leaf treats one spatial input vector as a single player and masking zeros the entire vector, giving the base case. This proves the finite feed-forward CNN induction directly, without numerical equivalence to the old scalar gate.')),
step('hnet-cnn-equivalence-refuted','区分更换gate与重组',r'对于同一孩子向量 $(1,0)$，逐scalar AND要求全部坐标非零，gate为0；group gate要求绝对值和非零，gate为1。选父线性值1时输出分别0与1，故更换gate不保持数值的原子句错误。新CNN本身仍有相同并集感受野掩码律，上述Shapley推导仍适用其自身输出。Lean已证明分组block归纳步和这个gate反例；尚未把整个向量CNN编码成独立递归数据类型，不能将scalar Expr宣称为该类型的完整实现。',decl='Harsanyi.Network.scalar_grouped_gate_counterexample',en=('Distinguish changing a gate from reindexing',r'For a child vector (1,0), scalar AND requires both coordinates nonzero and is closed; the grouped gate tests their nonzero absolute-value sum and is open. A parent linear value of 1 gives respective outputs 0 and 1, refuting the numerical-equivalence subclaim. The new CNN still has the union-field mask law, so the Shapley argument applies to its own output. Lean proves the grouped-block induction step and gate counterexample. A separate recursive datatype for the entire vector CNN is not yet encoded, and the scalar Expr is not claimed as its full implementation.'))],scope='修正完整有限重组和分组CNN数学归纳；原无过滤式/数值等价子句错误。Lean验证group block步、重组和反例，未编码整个递归向量CNN。',en_scope='Complete corrected finite regrouping and human CNN induction; the unfiltered equality and numerical-equivalence subclaims are false. Lean verifies the grouped-block step, regrouping and counterexample, but not an entire recursive vector-CNN datatype.',decls=['Harsanyi.Network.channel_grouping','Harsanyi.Network.groupedBlock_mask','Harsanyi.Network.scalar_grouped_gate_counterexample'])
R['hnet-cnn-regroup'].update(statement_assessment='refuted_subclaim',rewrite_role='corrected_proof_and_counterexample',verification_role='partial_scope_verified')

put('hnet-axiom-linearity','外引公理：经典 Shapley 线性性','Cited axiom: linearity of classical Shapley',r'\varphi_{U+W}(i)=\varphi_U(i)+\varphi_W(i),\qquad\varphi_{cV}(i)=c\varphi_V(i)',
'该外引性质有完整项目证明；不能把外引的性质陈述标为本篇原作者证明。','The cited property has a complete project proof; its source statement is not a local author proof.',[
step('hnet-linear-add','每个环境的边际',r'对每个 $T\subseteq N\setminus\{i\}$，$(U+W)(T\cup\{i\})-(U+W)(T)$ 等于 $U$ 和 $W$ 的两个边际之和。用相同阶乘权重乘此等式并对全部环境求和，有限和分配得到加法结论。',en=('Expand each environment marginal',r'At every environment, the marginal of the sum game is the sum of the two marginals. Multiply this equality by the common factorial weight and sum over all environments. Finite distributivity proves the addition claim.')),
step('hnet-linear-scale','标量提出',r'同样 $(cV)(T\cup\{i\})-(cV)(T)=c[V(T\cup\{i\})-V(T)]$，实数乘法分配律把固定 $c$ 提至全部有限和外，得到齐次结论。任意实数 $c$ 都成立，含零和负数。',en=('Move a fixed scalar outside the sum',r'The marginal of a scalar multiple is that scalar times the original marginal. Real distributivity moves the fixed scalar outside the finite weighted sum. This includes zero and negative scalars.'))],scope='外引公理的完整项目文字证明；本篇无本地proof block，尚无专用公理Lean声明。',en_scope='Complete project prose proof of the cited axiom; no local author proof block or dedicated axiom Lean declaration.')
put('hnet-axiom-dummy','外引公理：Dummy 玩家得到其单例收益','Cited axiom: a dummy receives its singleton reward',r'\bigl[\forall T\subseteq N\setminus\{i\},\ V(T\cup\{i\})=V(T)+V(\{i\})\bigr]\Longrightarrow\varphi(i)=V(\{i\})',
'所有边际等于同一个单例值，阶乘权重总和为一。','Every marginal equals the same singleton reward, and the factorial weights sum to one.',[
step('hnet-dummy-marginal','使用原Dummy前提',r'原前提逐环境直接给边际 $V(\{i\})$，所以 $\varphi(i)=V(\{i\})\sum_{T\subseteq N\setminus\{i\}}|T|!(n-|T|-1)!/n!$。本篇 $V(\varnothing)=0$，与原dummy定义一致。',en=('Use the original dummy premise',r'The stated premise makes each marginal exactly the singleton reward. Factor that fixed value out of the weighted sum. The source game is centered at the empty set, consistent with its dummy definition.')),
step('hnet-dummy-total','完整权重计数',r'按 $k=|T|$ 分组，有 $\binom{n-1}{k}$ 个环境，每组贡献 $\binom{n-1}{k}k!(n-1-k)!/n!=1/n$。$k$ 从0至 $n-1$ 恰有n项，故总和1。$n=1$ 时该唯一组也为1。代回即得结论。',r'\sum_{k=0}^{n-1}\binom{n-1}{k}\frac{k!(n-1-k)!}{n!}=\sum_{k=0}^{n-1}\frac1n=1',en=('Count all factorial weights',r'Group environments by size k. There are the corresponding binomial number of environments, and multiplying by the factorial weight cancels to 1/n. The sizes 0 through n-1 give exactly n groups, hence total weight one. This also covers n=1. Substituting proves the claim.'))],scope='原中心化Dummy公理的完整项目文字证明；本篇外引无本地proof block，尚无专用Lean声明。',en_scope='Complete project prose proof of the centered dummy axiom; cited without a local proof block or dedicated Lean declaration.')
put('hnet-axiom-symmetry','外引公理：经典 Shapley 对称性','Cited axiom: symmetry of classical Shapley',r'\bigl[\forall T\subseteq N\setminus\{i,j\},\ V(T\cup\{i\})=V(T\cup\{j\})\bigr]\Longrightarrow\varphi(i)=\varphi(j)',
'换位两个玩家建立全部环境之间的保基数双射。','Swap the two players to obtain a cardinality-preserving bijection of all environments.',[
step('hnet-symmetry-swap','把前提延伸成换位不变',r'$i=j$ 时结论自反。否则定义交换i和j而固定其他元素的置换 $\pi$。集合同时含两者或都不含时 $\pi T=T$；只含i时写成 $A\cup\{i\}$，原前提给 $V(\pi T)=V(T)$；只含j情形同理。因此对全部 $T\subseteq N$ 有换位不变。',en=('Show invariance under the transposition',r'The case of equal players is reflexive. Otherwise transpose them and fix all other players. A coalition containing both or neither is unchanged. A coalition containing exactly one is a common environment plus that player, so the original symmetry premise gives equal values after swapping. Thus the game is invariant on every coalition.')),
step('hnet-symmetry-bijection','逐项比较阶乘边际',r'$T\mapsto\pi T$ 是 $N\setminus\{i\}$ 的子集到 $N\setminus\{j\}$ 的子集的双射，且基数不变。又 $\pi(T\cup\{i\})=(\pi T)\cup\{j\}$。换位不变使两个边际相等，基数不变使阶乘权重相等，按双射重索引整个有限和即得到两归因相等。',en=('Compare the weighted marginals term by term',r'The transposition bijects i-environments with j-environments and preserves their cardinalities. It sends adding i to adding j in the swapped environment. Game invariance equates the marginal values, and cardinality preservation equates their factorial weights. Reindexing the full finite sum proves equal attributions.'))],scope='原对称性公理的完整项目文字证明；本篇外引无本地proof block，尚无专用Lean声明。',en_scope='Complete project prose proof of the original symmetry axiom; cited without a local author proof or dedicated Lean declaration.')
put('hnet-axiom-efficiency','外引公理：归因总和等于中心化收益','Cited axiom: total attribution equals the centered reward',r'\sum_{i\in N}\varphi(i)=V(N)=v(x)-v(x_\varnothing)',
'每个非空交互完整分配一次，空交互等于零。','Each nonempty dividend is allocated exactly once in total, and the empty dividend is zero.',[
step('hnet-efficiency-exchange','重排均分和',r'用已从经典定义证明的 Theorem1，对玩家求和后交换有限和。固定非空 $S$，恰有 $|S|$ 个玩家收到 $I(S)/|S|$，故其总贡献为 $I(S)$。空S没有玩家收到，原中心化空交互也为零。',r'\sum_{i\in N}\sum_{S\subseteq N:i\in S}\frac{I(S)}{|S|}=\sum_{\varnothing\ne S\subseteq N}I(S)',en=('Exchange the equal-allocation sums',r'Use the theorem already derived from the classical definition and exchange the finite player and coalition sums. Each nonempty coalition has exactly its cardinality many recipients of an equal share, giving its whole dividend. An empty coalition has no recipients, and its centered dividend is zero.')),
step('hnet-efficiency-reconstruct','重构与空总体',r'加入零空交互后，重构给全部和 $V(N)$。若N空，玩家和及中心化 $V(\varnothing)$ 均为零，结论仍成立。它不把原始输出基线b分给玩家。',decl='Harsanyi.reconstruction',en=('Reconstruct and check the empty universe',r'Adding the zero empty dividend allows reconstruction to give V(N). For an empty universe, both the player sum and centered empty reward are zero. The identity does not allocate the original output baseline to players.'))],shared=['shared-harsanyi-shapley-dividend','proof-finite-mobius-reconstruction-v2'],scope='完整项目文字证明；Lean已有经典均分与重构子步骤，尚无专用总玩家和声明。',en_scope='Complete project prose proof; Lean supplies the classical-allocation bridge and reconstruction substeps, without a dedicated total-player-sum declaration.')
put('hnet-conditional-attribution','F.8：仅对选中变量的条件 Shapley','F.8: conditional Shapley for the selected variables',r'g_Q(T)=g(T\cup(N\setminus Q)),\quad\varphi_Q(i)=\sum_j\mathbf1_{i\in R_j\cap Q}\frac{w_jz_j(x)}{|R_j\cap Q|}',
'其余坐标保持原值，因此所计算的是以Q为玩家总体的条件游戏。','The other coordinates keep their original values, defining a conditional game whose player universe is Q.',[
step('hnet-f8-game','严格定义每一个掩码',r'设选中集合 $Q\subseteq N$，未选中的F=N\Q坐标固定x，Q内基线仍r。其T掩码是原 $x_{T\cup F}$，条件空输入是 $x_F$，故条件游戏 $g_Q(T)=g(T\cup F)$，中心化 $g_Q(T)-g_Q(\varnothing)$。原页为实验选12，但数学推导适用于任意有限Q。它不同于把所有未选坐标置原r的限制游戏。',en=('Define every conditional mask',r'Fix the selected subset and keep all outside coordinates at their original input. Its mask T is the original mask with all outside coordinates retained. The conditional empty output is therefore the original output at that outside set. Center this conditional game at its own empty output. The experiment selects twelve players, while the argument applies to any finite selected subset. It differs from a game that masks every outside coordinate to the original baseline.')),
step('hnet-f8-field','证明场的缩减等价',r'因为 $R_j\subseteq N$，有 $R_j\subseteq T\cup F$ 当且仅当 $R_j\cap Q\subseteq T$：正向把场内Q坐标排除F后留在T；反向场内非Q坐标属于F、Q坐标由右侧保留。代入单元掩码律给 $u_{j,Q}(T)=z_j(x)\mathbf1_{R_j\cap Q\subseteq T}$。',decl='Harsanyi.Network.conditional_receptive',en=('Prove the reduced-field equivalence',r'A field contained in the original universe is retained by T together with the fixed outside coordinates exactly when its intersection with the selected universe lies in T. Forward, a selected field coordinate cannot lie outside the selected universe. Reverse, each field coordinate is either retained by T or is among the fixed outside coordinates. Substitution into the unit mask law gives the unanimity game on the reduced field.')),
step('hnet-f8-shapley','应用真实经典桥及全部边界',r'在总体Q上应用已证明的R1/R2条件和Shapley定理，得到所示式。只有 $i\in R_j\cap Q$ 的项计算分母，所以它正；若交集空，该单元在条件游戏恒定、中心化后为零。原页把分母写作 $|S|$ 并明确指“选中变量数量”，规范量就是 $|R_j\cap Q|$，不是原全集场的大小。效率给 $\sum_{i\in Q}\varphi_Q(i)=g(N)-g(F)$。',decl='Harsanyi.Network.conditional_forward_shapley',en=('Apply the actual classical bridge and check boundaries',r'Apply the proved mask-law Shapley theorem on the selected universe. Only a term whose reduced field contains the attributed player evaluates a denominator, making it positive. A field with empty selected intersection gives a constant conditional unit game and zero centered effects. Page 19 explicitly uses “number of selected variables” for its cardinality; the canonical quantity is the size of the reduced field, not the original field. Efficiency gives the difference between the full output and the fixed-outside output.'))],decls=['Harsanyi.Network.conditional_receptive','Harsanyi.Network.conditional_forward_shapley'],scope='完整条件游戏归因推导和真实阶乘定义Lean桥；不与全N玩家归因混同。',en_scope='Complete conditional-game attribution derivation and actual factorial-definition Lean bridge, distinguished from attribution with every original player.')
put('hnet-experiments','实验与实现资料：经验陈述逐页保留','Experiments and implementation: retain the empirical claims by page',r'\operatorname{RMSE}=\mathbb E_x\left[\frac1{\sqrt n}\|\varphi_x-\varphi_x^*\|_2\right]',
'分类、误差、训练代价、鲁棒性、可视化和训练超参数都是经验资料，不构成通用数学证明。','Classification, approximation error, training cost, robustness, visualization and hyperparameters are empirical material rather than universal mathematical proofs.',[
step('hnet-empirical-scope','正文和附录范围',r'正文4.2–4.3及F.1–F.7、F.9–F.10的图表和实现设置在逐页证据中完整保留。RMSE定义按原文，不把有限测试小误差当作任意网络精确性证明；精确性来自前面的架构与Shapley定理。12变量比较所用条件游戏另在F.8单独完整处理。',en=('Keep the main and appendix evidence in scope',r'The figures, tables and implementation settings of the main experiments and appendix experimental subsections remain in the page evidence. Retain the printed RMSE definition without treating small finite-test error as a proof for arbitrary networks. Exactness instead follows from the architecture and Shapley argument. The conditional game used in twelve-player comparisons is handled separately in F.8.'))],scope='经验与实现分类完整；不计作新的待证定理或Lean证明。',en_scope='Complete empirical and implementation classification, not an additional theorem or Lean proof.')
put('hnet-external-sparsity','外引：传统DNN的小交互集合描述','External citation: small interaction families in traditional DNNs',r'g_0(N)=\sum_{S\in\Omega}I(S)+\epsilon,\qquad\epsilon=\sum_{S\subseteq N:S\notin\Omega}I(S)',
'论文引用稀疏现象资料；没有对任意传统网络或给定误差阈值证明一个小集合。','The paper cites sparsity evidence; it does not prove a small-family theorem for arbitrary conventional networks at a specified error tolerance.',[
step('hnet-external-identity','恒等式与经验小量',r'有限重构把截断后余项写成遗漏交互之和，这是恒等式。它本身对 $|\Omega|$ 或 $|\epsilon|$ 没有上界：例如任意有限游戏可有所有非空交互均为1。传统DNN的“小而显著”经验句与引用Ren等2023a/b分别登记，不给未写出的量化标准。',en=('Separate the identity from the small-tail assertion',r'Finite reconstruction expresses the truncation remainder as the sum of omitted dividends. This identity alone bounds neither the retained family’s size nor the remainder; a finite game may have every nonempty dividend equal to one. The empirical small-and-salient description and cited sparsity works remain separately recorded without inventing a missing quantitative criterion.')),
step('hnet-external-source','本地证明状态',r'该外引在本篇无本地作者证明；本文不导入外部预印本作为正式版替代，也不把M单元上界替代传统网络的稀疏性结论。来源页与引用条目可追溯，当前范围是完整描述与适用边界。',en=('Record the local proof status',r'The cited claim has no local author proof in this paper. An external preprint is not substituted for the formal source, and the M-unit support bound is not used to establish sparsity of a conventional network. The citation and source pages remain traceable; the delivered scope is the complete description and its boundary.'))],scope='外引和经验稀疏主张的完整范围核查，无本地证明，不冒充通用稀疏性定理。',en_scope='Complete scope review of a cited empirical sparsity claim, with no local proof and no claimed general sparsity theorem.')

